00:13:41.551 --> 00:13:41.910
&gt;&gt; Health hazard.

00:13:41.911 --> 00:13:45.790
&gt;&gt; It is known to also
affect educational outcome.

00:13:45.791 --> 00:13:51.260
So, kids who are studying near
say railway lines [inaudible] ,

00:13:51.261 --> 00:13:56.480
so, many agencies which are
interested in managing noise.

00:13:56.481 --> 00:13:58.040
&gt;&gt; The air quality, for example,

00:13:58.041 --> 00:14:00.910
the study which the ISC
scientist, Professor Satish,

00:14:00.911 --> 00:14:03.085
