the traffic routing.

00:14:14.426 --> 00:14:16.880
There was a noticeable change in

00:14:16.881 --> 00:14:19.835
the asthma levels when of
course they changed some

00:14:19.836 --> 00:14:26.220
traffic- the paths for some
of these heavy vehicles.

00:14:26.221 --> 00:14:27.490
Over a six-month period,

00:14:27.491 --> 00:14:29.450
the asthma level actually went up

00:14:29.451 --> 00:14:32.030
and then it came down

00:14:32.031 --> 00:14:34.760
when the old routing
was reestablished.

00:14:34.761 --> 00:14:39.630
So, clearly, there is
a major connection note

00:14:39.631 --> 00:14:42.350
that the health and
even educational outcomes

00:14:42.351 --> 00:14:43.570
too much noise meant also

00:14:43.571 --> 00:14:45.270
prevent children from
focusing and so on.

00:14:45.271 --> 00:14:53.740
