00:22:48.166 --> 00:22:50.945
So, now what we are
saying is that,

00:22:50.946 --> 00:22:53.290
let us focus on the data layers.

00:22:53.291 --> 00:22:57.345
We really need a well
defined data exchange layer.

00:22:57.346 --> 00:22:59.825
It needs to be an open platform,

00:22:59.826 --> 00:23:01.370
with open APIs and data models.

00:23:01.371 --> 00:23:04.415
So, that instead of the siloed
it gets replaced by this,

00:23:04.416 --> 00:23:06.425
what I'm showing is
a hourglass model.

00:23:06.426 --> 00:23:07.660
At the neck of the hourglass

00:23:07.661 --> 00:23:09.190
is the key, that is the city,

00:23:09.191 --> 00:23:11.370
it's a little verbose
city data exchange

00:23:11.371 --> 00:23:12.650
and Edge Analytic stack.

00:23:12.651 --> 00:23:15.490
