rebuilt around it.

00:24:30.961 --> 00:24:32.420
If we do it right,

00:24:32.421 --> 00:24:35.620
we can have portability
across vendors for devices,

00:24:35.621 --> 00:24:37.800
as well as portability
across cities.

00:24:37.801 --> 00:24:39.300
Application development
Bangalore should

00:24:39.301 --> 00:24:40.875
work in Sura, et cetera.

00:24:40.876 --> 00:24:42.730
So, I think that
is what we should

00:24:42.731 --> 00:24:44.340
be aiming for as a country,

00:24:44.341 --> 00:24:46.480
not have all these cities
independently just

00:24:46.481 --> 00:24:49.125
doing their own little
thing and then,

00:24:49.126 --> 00:24:52.365
at least just let's see if
we can do it correctly;

00:24:52.366 --> 00:24:55.350
the smart city solutions.

00:24:55.351 --> 00:25:02.360
That is our hope. Yeah.

00:25:02.361 --> 00:25:07.170
&gt;&gt; Is there [inaudible]

00:25:07.171 --> 00:25:11.325
Or will it just be lost
after whatever happens?

00:25:11.326 --> 00:25:14.170
&gt;&gt; That is a good
question. So, nothing

00:25:14.171 --> 00:25:17.110
