00:26:42.881 --> 00:26:45.325
if people have showed up
to work or not maybe.

00:26:45.326 --> 00:26:46.880
Maybe that's the alert you want,

00:26:46.881 --> 00:26:49.420
so the raw data may not
be that useful there.

00:26:49.421 --> 00:26:53.980
So, I think that is also
open in some sense.

00:26:57.410 --> 00:27:03.230
&gt;&gt; Actually users forget to
store the use [inaudible]

00:27:03.231 --> 00:27:05.975
&gt;&gt; So, that is really why
the Edge Analytics comes in.

00:27:05.976 --> 00:27:08.550
In fact, from maybe,

00:27:08.551 --> 00:27:10.290
I'll just say why we need

00:27:10.291 --> 00:27:12.900
Edge Analytics is essentially
for what you pointed out.

00:27:12.901 --> 00:27:14.190
The amount of video data is

00:27:14.191 --> 00:27:15.825
just too much to
stream to the cloud.

00:27:15.826 --> 00:27:18.570
Data has been locally
stored locally consumed.

00:27:18.571 --> 00:27:21.160
&gt;&gt; Localized or local data?

00:27:21.161 --> 00:27:22.560
&gt;&gt; Local is what? So, local

00:27:22.561 --> 00:27:24.150
could be a word, maybe locality,

00:27:24.151 --> 00:27:25.540
again it depends on the kind of

00:27:25.541 --> 00:27:27.935
investment a city it
